  "text_pages": [
    "DEEP | Tohoku University\nDEEP\nDirect Enrollment Education Program For\nNatural Science Students\nTOP\n>\nFor International Students\n>\nExchange Programs\n>\nDEEP\nFor the exchange program of Graduate-level in the natural sciences, please visit\nCOLABS\npage.\nIntroduction\nCurriculum\nEligibility\nHow to Apply\nSupport\nContact\nPhoto Gallery\nFAQ\nIntroduction\nDEEP for Natural Science Students allows international undergraduate students to take classes alongside Japanese students. Participants will be able to experience the wide range of fields and highly specialized courses Tohoku University offers through taking General Education and specialized subjects.\nCurriculum\nStudents join the regular courses offered in each department, where the lectures are mostly given in Japanese.\nRequirement for Completion\n13 credits or more for one semester / 26 credits or more for one year\nTwo Tohoku University credits (TU credits) are to be given per course (90min.) in general.\nAcademic Calendar\nEligibility\nUndergraduate students enrolled at institutions having a formal student exchange agreement with Tohoku University.\nThey are required to provide evidence of proficiency in Japanese, such as the Japanese Language Proficiency Test (JLPT) N1 or equivalent certification issued by the student's home university. The relevant certificate(s) should be submitted at the time of application.\nHow to Apply\nStudents studying at Tohoku University's partner universities can contact their exchange program coordinator about an application and selection process of DEEP.  Application materials must be submitted only through the coordinator at the student's home institution.\nStudents will be formally registered in the following Schools/Faculties.\nThe applicant must specify their choice of School/Faculty with reading carefully our respective website for study field.\nFurther information\nFaculty of Science 理学部\nSchool of Medicene 医学部\nSchool of Dentistry 歯学部\nFaculty of Pharmaceutical 薬学部\nSchool of Engineering 工学部\nFaculty of Agriculture 農学部\nContact\nTohoku University Student Exchange Division\n41 Kawauchi, Aoba-ku, Sendai, Miyagi,\n980-8576 Japan\nContact Form\nOffice Hours: Monday-Friday 8:30-12:30, 13:30-17:15\nPhoto Gallery"
  ],
